###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#CostBenefitAnalysis
:CostBenefitAnalysis rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                              <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                     <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO" ;
                     <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "balancing potential benefits of introducing risk treatment against associated cost, effort or disadvantage" ;
