###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#DynamicRiskManagement
:DynamicRiskManagement rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                                <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
                       <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "ISO" ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "activities responsive to emerging and changing risks; a system which anticipates, detects, acknowledges and responds to change " ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#> ;
                       <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Dynamic Risk Management" .


###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#Effectiveness
:Effectiveness rdf:type owl:NamedIndividual ,
                        <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#Concept> ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/created> "30/07/2019" ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Natalie" ;
               <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "EASA SMS/dictionary" ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The degree to which something (safety controls) is successful in producing intended results (increased safety)" ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#> ;
               <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Effectiveness" .


