                 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/creator> "Natalie" ;
                 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "CUBE/Governance papers" ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "The motivation to act in an appropriate manner generated by a governance system" ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#> ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Obligation to Act" .


###  https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#OperationalCycle
