                 <http://purl.org/dc/terms/source> "Nick" ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#definition> "Risk that arises from the conduct of the operation itself" ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#inScheme> <https://ark.adaptcentre.ie/Ontologies/ARKRiskTerminology#> ;
                 <http://www.w3.org/2004/02/skos/core#prefLabel> "Operational Risk" .


